      <b data-is-speakable>Lebanon's government seeks global support amid Israel invasion</b>   <b data-is-speakable>Lebanese Prime Minister Najib Mikati said his country was facing “one of the most dangerous phases of its history” amid Israel’s ground incursion into southern Lebanon, which began late Monday.</b>
